1
00:00:00,479 --> 00:00:02,979
(Leonard(on board boat, at a party, dancing):)Excuse me, ladies,
but my pants are buzzing.

2
00:00:05,584 --> 00:00:08,994
North Sea, how can I "kelp" you?

3
00:00:09,922 --> 00:00:11,962
(Penny:)-Leonard?
-Penny?

4
00:00:12,124 --> 00:00:14,264
Hey, ifs Penny.
Everybody say "Hi" to Penny.

5
00:00:14,426 --> 00:00:16,096
(Everybody:)Hi, Penny!

6
00:00:17,262 --> 00:00:19,602
Ha! Sounds like you're
having a good time.

7
00:00:19,765 --> 00:00:22,335
Best time of my life!

8
00:00:24,336 --> 00:00:28,306
-isn't it 5:30 in the morning there?
-Is it?

9
00:00:28,474 --> 00:00:31,754
(Leonard:)Hey, everybody,
it's 5:30 in the morning!

10
00:00:34,813 --> 00:00:38,023
(Penny:)Okay, well, we were just calling you
because we were missing you.

11
00:00:38,183 --> 00:00:40,353
(Random voice:)-Iceberg!
-Oh! Hang on.

12
00:00:40,519 --> 00:00:43,689
(Sheldon:)-Are you in danger?
-No, it's a drinking game.

13
00:00:43,856 --> 00:00:46,526
(Leonard:)Whenever we see an iceberg,
we take a shot!

14
00:00:46,692 --> 00:00:50,002
(Everybody:)Berg! Berg!
Berg! Berg! Berg! Berg!

15
00:00:50,929 --> 00:00:54,139
Leonard? Leonard?

16
00:00:55,367 --> 00:00:57,937
(Penny:)I cannot believe we
were missing that jerk.

17
00:00:58,837 --> 00:01:05,027
(Sheldon:)You were.

